+# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
+# BrandForge — environment variables (safe to commit; values are placeholders)
+# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
+# Copy to .env.local for local dev. In production set these in Vercel →
+# Settings → Environment Variables, then REDEPLOY (values are read at build/run).
+# Every integration is independent: absent vars => that piece runs in demo mode
+# and says so, rather than faking success.
+
+# ── Email delivery (Resend) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
+# RESEND_FROM must be an address on a domain VERIFIED in Resend.
+RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
+RESEND_FROM=IAS <build@i-automate-shit.com>
+
+# ── Signed download links (the anti-spam delivery pattern) ───────────────────
+# Files are served via /d/<token> instead of attached. Requires BOTH a signing
+# secret AND an Upstash store; if either is missing, delivery falls back to
+# attaching (which is what lands in spam), so set all three.
+DOWNLOAD_SECRET=change-me-to-a-long-random-string
+UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=https://your-db.upstash.io
+UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=AXXXxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
+
+# Absolute origin for building links + unsubscribe URLs. Must be the real,
+# verified tool domain so links are same-domain (a deliverability trust signal).
+PUBLIC_ORIGIN=https://brandforge.iasbootcamp.com
+
+# ── CRM (optional) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
+# Persona capture is owned by n8n (resolveRetag, additive). Leave HUBSPOT_TOKEN
+# UNSET when N8N_WEBHOOK_URL is set, to avoid a double-write.
+N8N_WEBHOOK_URL=https://iautomateshit.app.n8n.cloud/webhook/ias-tool-capture
+# N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET=optional-shared-secret-sent-as-x-ias-secret
+# HUBSPOT_TOKEN=pat-xxxx   # fallback only; prefer n8n
